I acknowledge that I have reviewed this guide and the operation-specific plan. I understand the objectives, limitations, safety procedures, reporting requirements, and prohibition against unlawful conduct, entrapment, unnecessary intrusion, and evidence alteration. I agree to seek supervisory guidance whenever authority or legality is uncertain.

